sequenceDiagram
    participant EH as eval-hub Service
    participant Job as Adapter Pod<br/>(K8s Job)
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>/etc/eval-job/spec.json
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFP as KFP API Server<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant SDGModel as SDG Model<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant LLM as Target LLM<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>localhost HTTP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over EH,Sidecar: Flow 1: Simple Mode Scan
        EH->>Job: Schedule K8s Job<br/>(K8s RBAC)
        Job->>CM: Read job spec<br/>(volume mount)
        Job->>K8s: Read secrets<br/>(SA token, HTTPS/443)
        K8s-->>Job: model-auth, Data Connection
        Job->>LLM: Garak probes<br/>(HTTPS, API key Bearer)
        LLM-->>Job: Probe responses
        Job->>Job: Parse JSONL results<br/>Compute TBSA scores
        Job->>Sidecar: Report EvaluationResult<br/>(localhost HTTP)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over EH,Sidecar: Flow 2: KFP Mode Scan (Intents Workflow)
        EH->>Job: Schedule K8s Job<br/>(K8s RBAC)
        Job->>CM: Read job spec<br/>(volume mount)
        Job->>K8s: Read secrets + ConfigMap<br/>(SA token, HTTPS/443)
        K8s-->>Job: Credentials + KFP base image
        Job->>KFP: Submit 6-step pipeline<br/>(SA token / sidecar proxy)

        Note over KFP: Pipeline Execution
        KFP->>S3: validate - fetch taxonomy<br/>(AWS SigV4)
        KFP->>SDGModel: sdg_generate - create prompts<br/>(API key)
        SDGModel-->>KFP: Generated adversarial prompts
        KFP->>LLM: garak_scan - send probes<br/>(API key)
        LLM-->>KFP: Probe responses
        KFP->>S3: write_kfp_outputs - store results<br/>(AWS SigV4)

        Job->>KFP: Poll run status<br/>(SA token)
        KFP-->>Job: Run completed
        Job->>S3: Download results<br/>(AWS SigV4)
        S3-->>Job: Scan artifacts
        Job->>Job: Parse results, compute TBSA
        Job->>Sidecar: Report EvaluationResult<br/>(localhost HTTP)
    end
